## Checklists (plain text convention, no dedicated syntax group)

[ ] unchecked
[x] checked
[-] in progress

## Blocks

[blocks use brackets]: {
  content inside a block
}

[nested blocks]: {
  [outer]: {
    * list item inside outer
    [inner]: {
      * list item inside inner
    }
  }
}

## Pipes

| pipes are always just blue | add one anywhere | and it will just be blue
| however it does not !TRUMP|INLINE! emphasis

## Brackets, Braces, Angles, Parens

[these are]{also just always going}(to be blue)

## Money

valid $1234.99, $ or $0.10
$invalid $ $123. $123 $123.456


